  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/品種] Provide some shade at the heat of the day for golden and variegated leaf forms.\n[MBG/品種] Good heat and drought tolerance.\n[MBG/品種] 'Aureum' generally appreciates some light afternoon shade in hot summer climates such as the St.\n[MBG/品種] Louis area where its golden leaves tend to scorch when grown in full sun.\n[MBG/品種] Best with some afternoon shade in hot summer climates.\n[NC State/種] Some varieties of Oregano have golden or variegated leaves and these plants seem to do better with some shade at the heat of the day.\n[NC State/種] In general, Oregano plants tolerate heat and drought.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: North-facing or East-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
